{"id":"vod_sn_37278","vodId":"37278","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"出包王女 Darkness","name_cn":"出包王女 Darkness","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/fd09f56097ea3bdc0f6c27e94ff475d6.jpg"},"summary":"结城梨斗（渡边明乃 配音）是一位平凡的高中生，暗恋着青梅竹马西连寺春菜（矢作纱友里 配音），然而，腼腆的梨斗决心将这份真挚地感情深深埋藏在心底，每日只是在角落里偷偷地凝望着自己的女神。　　某日，一位名叫菈菈·萨塔琳·戴比路克（户松遥 配音）的外星女王突然从天而降，成为了梨斗的同居人，就这样，梨斗开始了和菈菈一起的没羞没臊地生活。金色暗影（福圆美里 配音）本是为了暗杀梨斗而来的宇宙第一杀手，却莫名其妙地留在了地球，为了让金色暗影重新返回杀手界，黑咲芽亚（井口裕香 配音）被派出来到了梨斗的身边，这一次，又会有怎样有趣的故事发生呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:50:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rYkztHrkXi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V5sANP6ei31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bi4DASSDs51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/niGU0CC7FU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FCLXCJ9GkM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SMkUcELsB41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aBNurL476K1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/afvkHcU75T1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cPDxx14ew01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qSbvMYqewZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Xhg1KVp6Jr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1CJ4n81LTh1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:12.718Z"}